Note: GOVERNANCE.md deliberately does not name specific individuals
in the seated steering committee. Once the first slate is confirmed
(e.g., after co-founder agreement + at least one external member),
add a STEERING_COMMITTEE.md with names + terms + affiliations. That
file is a governance-genre doc where naming is standard nonprofit
practice.

Interim state (2026-09-19): co-founders act as an interim committee.
Names are on the emrgi.com team page — the site is the source of
truth for identity until a formal STEERING_COMMITTEE.md is published.
